OL,3,GNEWSAFurther sexual assault charge in
OL,4,Awife abuse trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA further charge of sexual assault has
OL,7,Fbeen made against one of four men on
OL,8,Ftrial for the abuse of a woman who was
OL,9,Fadvertised by her husband on the
OL,10,Finternet for sex.
OL,12,FPhilip Young has pleaded guilty to
OL,13,Fmultiple charges of drugging and
OL,14,Fsexually abusing his wife, Joanne
OL,15,FYoung, during a 13-year period at their
OL,16,Fhome in Swindon, Wiltshire.
OL,18,FFour other men are on trial at
OL,19,FWinchester Crown Court accused of
OL,20,Fsexually abusing Joanne, who has waived
OL,21,Fher right to anonymity.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
