OL,3,GNEWSAFurther sexual assault charge in
OL,4,Awife abuse trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FMohammed Hassan, 38, from Swindon, has
OL,7,Fnow pleaded not guilty to sexual
OL,8,Fassault of Joanne in February 2023
OL,9,Fafter previously denying one count of
OL,10,Fsexual touching on the same date.
